Not covered by the MIT License above
====================================

- The Windows UCRT math routines at the end of shared/engine/np.js (crtExp, crtCos, crtPow, crtLog, crtLog2,
  crtLog1p) replay Microsoft's ucrtbase.dll (https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/windows/universal-crt-deployment)
  so that the engine gives the same results bit for bit. kimlachal does not offer them under the MIT License.

